{"id":37421859174,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAItoRBZg","head_branch":"fix/DHIS2-21927-outlier-stats-numeric-scope_2.43","head_sha":"52df2b8503dbe42bbe543e8b3b5d1d9672661b5c","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":56984,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"backport: fix: exclude non-numeric data elements from outlier stats to avoid double precision overflow [DHIS2-21927]","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":101362787738,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAXmbFlmg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421859174","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421859174","pull_requests":[{"id":4754834154,"number":25493,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/25493","head":{"ref":"fix/DHIS2-21927-outlier-stats-numeric-scope_2.43","sha":"52df2b8503dbe42bbe543e8b3b5d1d9672661b5c","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"2.43","sha":"7ca906184b07f38740dddaae7b4012f9f538b6bb","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-10-06T06:05:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:22:21Z","run_started_at":"2026-10-06T06:05:29Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421859174/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421859174/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/101362787738","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421859174/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421859174/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421859174/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: exclude non-numeric data elements from outlier stats to avoid double precision overflow [DHIS2-21927] (#24688)\n\n* fix: exclude text/date data elements from outlier stats to avoid double precision overflow [DHIS2-21927]\n\nAnalytics table population crashes when a TEXT/LONG_TEXT data element holds\na value that looks like scientific notation (e.g. \"224E10000913\"), because\ngetOutliersJoinStatement()'s stats subquery scans the entire datavalue table\nusing a regex that accepts scientific notation, with no restriction on the\ndata element's valuetype. Postgres treats the string as a number with an\nastronomically large exponent and aborts the cast to double precision,\nfailing the whole partition build.\n\nScope the outlier stats subquery to NUMERIC_TYPES data elements only, since\nz-score/MAD stats are meaningless for text/date/boolean values, and reuse\nthe existing NUMERIC_REGEXP (no scientific notation) as defense-in-depth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Resolve SQ issue\n\n* fix: restore closing brace dropped during merge in JdbcAnalyticsTableManagerTest\n\nThe merge of master into this branch dropped the closing brace and\n@Test annotation between testGetOutliersJoinStatementScopedToNumericDataElements\nand testRemoveLatestPartitionOverlap, breaking compilation for the whole module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"52df2b8503dbe42bbe543e8b3b5d1d9672661b5c","tree_id":"609566fc05ed26f4bfa83b2c841826c1e298c125","timestamp":"2026-10-06T06:05:19Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_